tio":0.4391},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4322},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.42369999999999997},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.4114},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.396},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3908}],"script":{"source_path":"k0syred20D0.en-orig.vtt","words":237,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"A teenage Peshwa had just survived the"},{"sec":2,"text":"Nizam, but now his greatest threat came"},{"sec":4.1,"text":"from his own family, his uncle."},{"sec":5.7,"text":"Raghunath Rao wanted power and Madhav"},{"sec":7.6,"text":"Rao refused to give it up. Raghunath Rao"},{"sec":9.5,"text":"made a deal with the devil. He promised"},{"sec":11.2,"text":"Nizam territory worth 51 lakhs a year in"},{"sec":13.7,"text":"exchange for troops. Then he marched on"},{"sec":16,"text":"Pune. The Nizam's contingent joined him"},{"sec":18.4,"text":"and a much larger army led by Nizam Ali"},{"sec":20.8,"text":"was on its way from Hyderabad, but the"},{"sec":22.4,"text":"real attack came from inside Peshwa's"},{"sec":24.5,"text":"own army. Raghunath Rao's men had"},{"sec":26.4,"text":"secretly bribed Peshwa's commanders. At"},{"sec":28.7,"text":"Alegaon in the middle of the battle,"},{"sec":30.5,"text":"they fled the field and the Peshwa's"},{"sec":32.1,"text":"army collapsed. The Peshwa had high"},{"sec":34,"text":"fever, his soldiers hadn't eaten in two"},{"sec":36.1,"text":"days and the Nizam's army was coming to"},{"sec":38.3,"text":"finish him off. So Madhav Rao did"},{"sec":40.1,"text":"something no one expected. He crossed"},{"sec":41.9,"text":"the Bhima river at night, walked into"},{"sec":43.5,"text":"his uncle's tent and surrendered to"},{"sec":45.4,"text":"avoid a civil war. It worked. Raghunath"},{"sec":47.4,"text":"Rao embraced him and said, \"Everything"},{"sec":49.6,"text":"is yours.\" But nothing was his."},{"sec":51.4,"text":"Raghunath Rao took control of his"},{"sec":52.9,"text":"empire, put his loyalists in power and"},{"sec":55,"text":"made Peshwa and his mother virtual"},{"sec":57,"text":"prisoners. But why did Peshwa give up?"},{"sec":59,"text":"Madhav Rao knew one more battle would"},{"sec":60.8,"text":"destroy Maratha empire beyond recovery."},{"sec":63.2,"text":"He chose to lose his power rather than"},{"sec":65.2,"text":"his empire [music] and the Nizam was"},{"sec":66.8,"text":"about to turn on both of them."}],"text":""}}